Ensures a blank line after the last `import`:

invalid:

```js
import x from "foo";
const xCopy = x;
import z from "bar";
const STRING = "hey";
// test
class Y {}
```

valid:

```js
import x from "foo";
const xCopy = x;
import z from "bar";

const STRING = "hey";
// test
class Y {}
```
